# Everything in this repository is stored and checked out with LF endings.
#
# Without this, core.autocrlf decides, and it is a per-machine setting rather
# than a property of the repository: it is true on the machine this was built
# on, so every text file would be rewritten to CRLF the next time Git touched
# one, turning a one-line change into a diff against the whole tree. Pinning it
# here means a checkout is the same on every machine and a diff shows only what
# somebody actually edited.
#
# Git detects the two screenshots as binary on its own; naming them is so that
# a later addition to docs/evidence cannot be mangled by a rule meant for text.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
